give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Race to the Bottom\"", "italic": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Clockmaker", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing how many steps from the Demon to its nearest Minion."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Empath", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn how many of your 2 alive neighbors are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Dreamer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose a player (not yourself or Travellers): you learn 1 good & 1 evil character, 1 of which is correct."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Slayer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, publicly choose a player: if they are the Demon, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Courtier", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a character: they are drunk for 3 nights & 3 days."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mayor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf only 3 players live & no execution occurs, your team wins. If you die at night, another player might die instead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lunatic", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou think you are a Demon, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are & who you choose at night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Klutz", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you learn that you died, publicly choose 1 alive player: if they are evil, your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Scarlet Woman", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf there are 5 or more players alive & the Demon dies, you become the Demon. (Travellers don't count.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Spy", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, you see the Grimoire. You might register as good & as a Townsfolk or Outsider, even if dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Vortox", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Townsfolk abilities yield false info. Each day, if no-one is executed, evil wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Doomsayer", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nIf 4 or more players live, each living player may publicly choose (once per game) that a player of their own alignment dies."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sentinel", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nThere might be 1 extra or 1 fewer Outsider in play."]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Race to the Bottom Script", "italic": false, "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Race to the Bottom\"", "italic": false, "color": "dark_blue"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]